mid">17664376</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal">Daniels SR, Greer FR, and the Committee on Nutrition. Lipid screening and cardiovascular health in childhood. <source>Pediatrics</source><year>2008</year>;<volume>122</volume>:<fpage>198</fpage>-208.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18596007</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><notes notes-type="citation-text"><p><bold>Cite this as: </bold><italic>BMJ</italic> 2008;337:a2423</p></notes></back></article>